<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 7,879 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 999 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  200   (175 and 180)</p>
<p>    Good		128   (128 and 145)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     117   (117 and 122)</p>
<p>    Medium	    107   (106 and  89)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 90   ( 90 and  74)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 200 pence for a North India PF.</p>
</text>
